WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.076 --> 00:00:13.559
The wind stopped.

2
00:00:14.540 --> 00:00:18.341
Wukong jumped to his feet and called back the little Wukongs.

3
00:00:23.882 --> 00:00:24.743
moaned Bajie.

4
00:00:24.763 --> 00:00:26.603
"I need a nap."

5
00:00:27.503 --> 00:00:28.124
"Get up!"

6
00:00:28.404 --> 00:00:29.144
yelled the monkey.

7
00:00:29.984 --> 00:00:33.265
"We have to save the Tang Monk before the demon king eats him!"

8
00:00:35.086 --> 00:00:36.387
Bajie rubbed his head.

9
00:00:37.487 --> 00:00:38.428
can we save him?

10
00:00:38.888 --> 00:00:40.549
That wind was too powerful."

11
00:00:41.589 --> 00:00:43.950
Wukong tapped his chin and thought.

12
00:00:43.970 --> 00:00:47.672
"I'll sneak into the cave to see what I can find out."

13
00:00:55.015 --> 00:01:00.542
The monkey changed into a mosquito and squeezed through a crack in the cave's door.

14
00:01:01.603 --> 00:01:04.425
Deep in the cave, he heard someone crying.

15
00:01:04.445 --> 00:01:09.208
"That's the Tang Monk," thought Wukong.

16
00:01:13.391 --> 00:01:16.533
The monkey found his master tied up in a dark room.

17
00:01:18.655 --> 00:01:19.455
cried Wukong.

18
00:01:20.616 --> 00:01:22.317
He landed on the monk's shoulder.

19
00:01:24.398 --> 00:01:26.240
asked the Tang Monk, looking around.

20
00:01:27.180 --> 00:01:27.800
"Where are you?"

21
00:01:29.381 --> 00:01:31.101
on your shoulder," said Wukong.

22
00:01:31.121 --> 00:01:33.282
"I turned myself into a mosquito."

23
00:01:35.042 --> 00:01:36.943
must save me," said the Tang Monk.

24
00:01:37.743 --> 00:01:39.383
He started to cry again.

25
00:01:42.624 --> 00:01:44.165
crying," said Wukong.

26
00:01:44.185 --> 00:01:45.725
"You'll be free soon.

27
00:01:47.406 --> 00:01:48.846
I must defeat the demon king.

28
00:01:49.566 --> 00:01:50.046
I'll be back!"

29
00:01:52.447 --> 00:01:55.668
Wukong flew down a tunnel and arrived in the throne room.

30
00:01:58.376 --> 00:02:01.098
Yellow Wind was talking to some other demons.

31
00:02:01.118 --> 00:02:06.981
"Your wind magic blew Sun Wukong away," said one demon.

32
00:02:08.301 --> 00:02:10.062
Wind laughed.

33
00:02:10.082 --> 00:02:14.545
"Only the bodhisattva Lingji can stop my wind magic.

34
00:02:16.266 --> 00:02:16.846
a fire.

35
00:02:17.446 --> 00:02:19.287
We're having a feast tonight!"

36
00:02:21.168 --> 00:02:22.009
thought Wukong.

37
00:02:22.029 --> 00:02:25.230
"The bodhisattva Lingji lives on Mount Sumeru.

38
00:02:25.991 --> 00:02:30.848
I will ask him for help—quickly!"

39
00:02:30.888 --> 00:02:33.589
The monkey leaped onto a cloud and raced through the sky.

40
00:02:39.092 --> 00:02:43.473
When he arrived on Mount Sumeru, Lingji came out of his pagoda.

41
00:02:45.334 --> 00:02:47.835
nice to see you, Wukong," said Lingji.

42
00:02:47.855 --> 00:02:49.836
"Would you like some tea?"

43
00:02:51.597 --> 00:02:53.037
thank you," said Wukong.

44
00:02:53.057 --> 00:02:54.638
"I have an emergency!"

45
00:02:55.679 --> 00:02:58.880
He quickly told the bodhisattva everything that had happened.

46
00:02:59.892 --> 00:03:02.154
"I tried to fight the demon," said the monkey.

47
00:03:02.174 --> 00:03:05.237
"But then he used powerful wind magic."

48
00:03:05.257 --> 00:03:10.121
"I know who the great king Yellow Wind is," said Lingji.

49
00:03:11.302 --> 00:03:12.323
a weasel spirit.

50
00:03:13.124 --> 00:03:15.305
Buddha asked me to keep an eye on him.

51
00:03:16.146 --> 00:03:19.409
I told the spirit he could live on that mountain if he behaved."

52
00:03:21.351 --> 00:03:21.971
shook his head.

53
00:03:21.991 --> 00:03:24.353
"I guess he's not behaving anymore."

54
00:03:25.374 --> 00:03:26.035
"Can you help me?"

55
00:03:26.395 --> 00:03:27.196
asked Wukong.

56
00:03:27.916 --> 00:03:30.438
"They're going to eat the Tang Monk tonight!"

57
00:03:30.458 --> 00:03:33.380
"Of course," said Lingji.

58
00:03:34.461 --> 00:03:38.384
He picked up a staff and put a small object into his robe.

59
00:03:38.404 --> 00:03:39.905
"Let's go."

60
00:03:42.447 --> 00:03:46.250
Soon they were in the sky, looking down at the cave door.

61
00:03:46.270 --> 00:03:49.472
"Knock on the door," said Lingji.

62
00:03:50.453 --> 00:03:51.594
the demon to come out.

63
00:03:51.914 --> 00:03:55.172
I'll do the rest."

64
00:03:55.252 --> 00:03:58.933
Wukong went down to the cave door and took out his iron bar.

65
00:04:01.894 --> 00:04:04.295
The door turned into a pile of rubble.

66
00:04:05.375 --> 00:04:09.656
Yellow Wind rushed outside and yelled, "You smashed my door!"

67
00:04:11.437 --> 00:04:13.117
took three deep breaths.

68
00:04:22.020 --> 00:04:24.528
But nothing happened.

69
00:04:24.588 --> 00:04:25.909
"Huh?" said Yellow Wind.

70
00:04:27.009 --> 00:04:30.011
He looked up and saw Lingji in the sky.

71
00:04:31.051 --> 00:04:34.133
The bodhisattva was holding a pearl in one hand.

72
00:04:34.153 --> 00:04:37.194
"The wind-stopping pearl!"

73
00:04:37.514 --> 00:04:38.575
cried Yellow Wind.

74
00:04:39.255 --> 00:04:40.556
The demon king ran.

75
00:04:41.636 --> 00:04:45.038
Lingji threw his staff, which turned into a golden dragon.

76
00:04:47.199 --> 00:04:49.740
The dragon threw Yellow Wind against some rocks.

77
00:04:50.828 --> 00:04:54.431
There was a puff of smoke, and the demon turned into a yellow weasel.

78
00:04:55.851 --> 00:04:57.352
Lingji picked up the weasel.

79
00:04:57.372 --> 00:05:00.775
"I'll bring him to Buddha to be punished, Wukong.

80
00:05:01.495 --> 00:05:03.256
You may go find your companions.

81
00:05:04.357 --> 00:05:04.838
Good luck!"

82
00:05:06.759 --> 00:05:10.221
Wukong ran into the cave and chased away the other demons.

83
00:05:12.843 --> 00:05:14.704
Then he untied the Tang Monk.

84
00:05:16.786 --> 00:05:20.108
The two of them went back out and found Bajie sleeping.

85
00:05:21.533 --> 00:05:22.559
"Wake up, lazy!"

86
00:05:22.901 --> 00:05:23.886
shouted Wukong.
